"user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"subscribed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2013-10-31T23:31:37Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/comments/27546715","html_url":"https://github.com/yiisoft/yii2/issues/1107#issuecomment-27546715","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/1107","id":27546715,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI3NTQ2NzE1","user":{"login":"resurtm","id":100198,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDE5OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/100198?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/resurtm","html_url":"https://github.com/resurtm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/resurtm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/resurtm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/resurtm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/resurtm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/resurtm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/resurtm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/resurtm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/resurtm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/resurtm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2013-11-01T04:08:23Z","updated_at":"2013-11-01T04:09:31Z","body":"I thought namespaces were created in order to solve such name collisions and to allow to have classes with the same names in different groups. What exactly was wrong with the way offered by @klimov-paul (i would use `use \\app\\models\\search\\Kontoplan as KontoplanSearch;` though)?\n\nSamples:\n\n```\n├─ common\n├─ backend\n└─ frontend\n   ├─ controllers\n   ├─ views\n   └─ models\n      ├─ search\n      │  ├─ User\n      │  ├─ Post\n      │  ├─ Comment\n      │  ├─ Car\n      │  └─ City\n      ├─ User\n      ├─ Post\n      ├─ Comment\n      ├─ Car\n      └─ City\n```\n\n```\nmodels\n├─ search\n│  ├─ UserSearch\n│  ├─ PostSearch\n│  ├─ CommentSearch\n│  ├─ CarSearch\n│  └─ CitySearch\n├─ User\n├─ Post\n├─ Comment\n├─ Car\n└─ City\n```\n\nIMO the former looks much better than the latter.\n\nI'd like to vote to remove validation rule introduced in 1c1cd863cadf87dde34d9b0ba5204aa85bd8c691. Isn't it better to allow an end developer to decide what would fit his or her project better?\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/comments/27546715/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"resurtm","id":100198,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDE5OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/100198?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/resurtm","html_url":"https://github.com/resurtm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/resurtm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/resurtm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/resurtm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/resurtm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/resurtm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/resurtm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/resurtm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/resurtm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/resurtm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":73473622,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50NzM0NzM2MjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yiisoft/yii2/issues/events/73473622","actor":{"login":"klimov-paul","id":1482054,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODIwNTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1482054?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kli